<title>USA: Castelle names Roy Prasad president.</title>
<headline>Castelle names Roy Prasad president.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Castelle Inc on Wednesday said it named Roy Prasad president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Prasad replaces Arthur Bruno, who remains chairman.</p>
<p>Prasad was a co-founder and general manager of Personal CAD Systems Inc., a $20 million software company.</p>
<p>Castelle designs and markets network servers for increased productivity in workgroups and distributed enterprise applications.</p>
</text>
